    {
      "en": "I make my way into Kaori's apartment after she doesn't answer the door so I can make sure she's alive. And she is. She's just watching TV.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
